     "html": "<p>Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<div data-block-id=\"block-1b650049-baea-4309-ac66-f28753056020\">\n<p>We hope you have found the resources we've shared valuable as you embark on your private labeling journey.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We are dedicated to being your trusted partner in private label supplements. With more than 50 years in the industry and a commitment to <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">Truth In Labeling</a>, we offer a comprehensive range of services to support your business every step of the way.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Here are a few of the benefits we offer:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Extensive Product Selection: </strong>Choose from over 250 premium, doctor-formulated supplements, including capsules, tablets, powders, soft gels, and liquids. Your line can be specialized to fit your unique customers.&nbsp;<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong> We prioritize quality at every step, ensuring that all our products meet the highest industry standards. <span style=\"background:#F8DDD9;border-bottom:2px solid #9B3B31;\" data-praxera-review=\"claim\">Our facilities</span> are FDA-inspected and GMP-certified.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Turn-Key Solutions: </strong>We offer comprehensive support from product development to labeling, making it easy for you to bring your products to market quickly.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Marketing Support: </strong>Leverage our expertise in marketing and branding to effectively promote your new supplement line.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ready to take the next step? <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">Schedule a free consultation</a> with our team to explore how we can help you achieve your business goals.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We look forward to the opportunity to work with you and support your journey to success!</p>\n</div>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
